<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1735291028"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:42.668"><div begin="15.218" end="41.822" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.218" end="21.652" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.218" end="15.697">传</span><span begin="15.697" end="16.339">来法</span><span begin="16.339" end="17.038">语</span> <span begin="17.038" end="17.313">问</span><span begin="17.313" end="17.881">你</span><span begin="17.881" end="18.171">是</span><span begin="18.171" end="18.822">我</span><span begin="18.822" end="19.088">的</span><span begin="19.088" end="20.531">家</span><span begin="20.531" end="20.895">属</span><span begin="20.895" end="21.652">吧</span></p><p begin="22.542" end="28.886" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.542" end="22.885">原</span><span begin="22.885" end="23.518">来我</span><span begin="23.518" end="24.119">已</span><span begin="24.119" end="24.422">自</span><span begin="24.422" end="25.031">那</span><span begin="25.031" end="25.285">白</span><span begin="25.285" end="25.918">朗</span><span begin="25.918" end="26.253">之</span><span begin="26.253" end="27.430">巅</span><span begin="27.612" end="27.962">堕</span><span begin="27.962" end="28.886">下</span></p><p begin="29.666" end="34.337" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.666" end="30.374">明明</span><span begin="30.374" end="30.629">分</span><span begin="30.629" end="31.422">开</span> <span begin="31.422" end="31.751">为</span><span begin="31.751" end="32.454">何打</span><span begin="32.454" end="33.204">这</span><span begin="33.204" end="33.432">号</span><span begin="33.432" end="34.337">码</span></p><p begin="36.248" end="41.822" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.248" end="36.952">你可</span><span begin="36.952" end="37.197">会</span><span begin="37.197" end="37.837">很不</span><span begin="37.837" end="38.442">解</span> <span begin="38.442" end="38.743">我</span><span begin="38.743" end="39.209">怎</span><span begin="39.209" end="39.546">不</span><span begin="39.546" end="40.29